<codeline lineno="53"><highlight class="comment">/**</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="54"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*<sp/>@brief<sp/>使用默认计算上下文计算<sp/>Laplace<sp/>变换,并返回条件/ROC<sp/>容器.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="55"><highlight class="comment"><sp/>*/</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="56"><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="d1/d2f/lmcas__export_8hpp_1afed34265f956e39cc483c640121efc3e" kindref="member">LMCAS_API</ref><sp/><ref refid="de/dde/namespaceLMCAS_1aa499780a981b364501714d180cc277b6" kindref="member">TransformEngineResult</ref><sp/><ref refid="de/dde/namespaceLMCAS_1a08d7f82d256a391696b6218c96dc7023" kindref="member">laplace_transform_checked</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
